{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"852737863170654259","content":"Kukudh flies back in, transforms back to imp form, and watches Sabrine, still painting intensely. somehow, she has not gotten any paint on her tongue, much to their surprise.\n\nthey wait with the fresh bugberry given by Roy, to give to Sabrine when her task is done.","created_at":"2021-07-16T18:42:57.042000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865664822849830932","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
